      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Erie Canal’s 1825 completion boosted regional trade along the Mohawk River corridor, yet Clifton Knolls‑Mill Creek remained a quiet farming hamlet for decades.",
